sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer as Existing minute scheduler
    participant App as OrderCommandService
    participant DB as Order PostgreSQL and command store
    participant Peers as Requester and Supplier read checks
    participant Credit as Credit Service
    participant Broker as Existing compensation Pub/Sub
    Note over Timer,DB: CHANGE-164; existing feature gates and plan expiry remain
    loop Subsequent passes while the saved plan is eligible
        Timer->>DB: SQL due IDs; exclude holds, used, linked, expired, blocked and unsafe commands
        Note over DB: Older due work before recently failed plans; limit100
        Timer->>App: submitAutomatic(originalId)
        App->>DB: Latest actor/order-scoped automatic attempt, limit1
        alt Pending, unsafe or successful saved attempt
            App-->>Timer: Return existing outcome; no new forward effect
        else No attempt or safely rejected terminal attempt
            App->>Credit: Read original refund readiness
            alt Refund not confirmed or read unavailable
                App-->>Timer: Skip this pass; no reservation command sent
            else Refund confirmed
                App->>DB: Lock original; recheck plan and latest command; register immutable K and candidate
                Note over DB: First key retained; later safe attempt gets new retry UUID key and candidate
                App->>Peers: Fresh requester and location eligibility reads
                alt Validation fails before Credit mutation
                    App->>DB: Save failed no-effect outcome; preserve plan for later eligible pass
                else Validation passes
                    App->>DB: Commit possible-effect barrier
                    App->>Credit: One keyed reservation for this candidate
                    alt Authoritative no-effect rejection
                        App->>DB: Save terminal rejected, fully compensated outcome
                    else Applied and final local commit succeeds
                        App->>DB: Atomically save successor, original link, plan used, receipt and SUCCESS
                        Note over DB: Later passes no longer select this original
                    else Applied or uncertain and local success not committed
                        App->>DB: Commit compensation intent and outbox; keep pending guard
                        App->>Broker: Existing after-commit compensation
                        Broker->>Credit: Reverse or fence exact old command
                        Credit->>Broker: Durable committed result
                        Broker->>App: Bound compensation result
                        App->>DB: Inbox plus terminal compensated outcome, or retain reconciliation
                        Note over DB: New attempt only after confirmed safe terminal outcome
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
